# The title, Settings (the profile name typed into its text field, the
# theme, the colour-vision markers, the runtime's Options), Help, and a
# Practice round: pause, Help from the pause, Give up with its confirm, the
# results' lost headline, New practice grid.
until 300 =▶ Play
frames 20
expect Your travel journal awaits
click =Settings
until 60 Display name
frames 10
click =Display name
frames 5
click Guest
frames 5
type Ada
frames 10
expect Color-vision-safe markers
click =Color-vision-safe markers
frames 5
key F1 2
frames 30
key F1 2
frames 30
click =← Back
until 60 Ada
frames 10
click =Help
until 60 How to play
frames 10
expect Enter letters
expect Move around
click =← Back
until 60 =▶ Play
frames 10
click =▶ Play
until 60 Practice
frames 10
click =Practice
until 60 Practice — easy
frames 10
click Practice — easy
until 60 1 Across —
frames 20
type Q
frames 5
click =Pause
until 30 Paused
frames 10
click =Help #2
until 60 How to play
frames 10
click =← Back
until 60 Paused
frames 10
click =Resume
frames 10
hold ShiftLeft
frames 2
key Tab 1
frames 2
release ShiftLeft
